cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the lightning fatality incident counts, municipal risk classifications,
  or derived geospatial maps from LightningRiskMX, please cite the original
  research article listed below.
type: dataset
title: "LightningRiskMX: Geospatial representations of lightning fatality risk in Mexico"
abstract: >-
  Ready-to-use GeoJSON datasets and maps representing published municipal
  lightning fatality incidents and risk classifications in Mexico.
  The scientific data originate from the supplementary material of Jaramillo
  and Dominguez (2024); administrative boundary geometries are provided
  separately through INEGI and CONABIO.
authors:
